{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2022-09-19 08:21:00', 'title': 'XCEL ENERGY AND BLOOM ENERGY TO PRODUCE ZERO-CARBON HYDROGEN AT NUCLEAR FACILITY', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF. & MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BLOOM ENERGY (NYSE: BE) ANNOUNCED PLANS TO INSTALL AN ELECTROLYZER AT THE XCEL ENERGY (NASDAQ:XEL) PRAIRIE ISLAND NUCLEAR GENERATING PLANT IN WELCH, MINNESOTA. THE INSTALLATION IS DESIGNED TO AUGMENT EXISTING CLEAN ENERGY NUCLEAR INFRASTRUCTURE TO CREATE IMMEDIATE AND SCALABLE PATHWAYS TO PRODUCE COST-EFFICIENT, CLEAN HYDROGEN, SUPPORTING THE GROWING HYDROGEN ECONOMY WHILE ENHANCING VALUE FOR OPERATORS OF ZERO-CARBON NUCLEAR FACILITIES. BLOOM ENE'}